hash 14475bdae7309b69
note Restores a place: the tour by name if it still exists, the step by StepId through select_step with Scrolling::Stay when it still exists, otherwise the focused symbol found again by its key, or no focus at all when the place had none (going back to the start page leaves nothing focused); then file and lines, the document and Source scroll offsets and the graph camera as they were when the place was left, and the tab. It records the restored place as the last one so the frame end does not push it again.

